<title>RUSSIA: Russian Oct unemployment steady at 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Oct unemployment steady at 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia was unchanged at 6.7 million or 9.2 percent of the workforce at the end of October, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 OCT 96     SEP 96     OCT 95</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)	6.73	 6.70	 6.41</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	9.2	  9.2	  8.1</p>
<p>    officially registered (million)  2.46	 2.47	 2.14</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
